1: Functional Req:
       1.1:Cluster Resource management:
             a: The system shold allow users to add clusters(along with their infrastructure configurations like CPU and memory)
             b:Clusters can run multiple jobs simultaneously, provided they have enough availalbe resources to satisfy all the running jobs requiremnts.
             c: Resources of a cluster should be allocated to a job for the entire duration of its execution
    2: Job Submission:
        a: The System should allow users to submit jobs with specific infrastructure requirements(CPU,RAM) and job priority
        b: Each job will include the execution time, specifying how long the job will use the allocated resources
    a:Submit Job
        resources
        priority
    3: Job Scheduling:
        a: The System Should dispatch jobs to clusters based on resource availability
        b: jobs should be scheduled for a specific time duration(execution time).
        c: Job Priority Should be considered when determining which job to run first in case of resource contention

    b: Resource Management System

    4: Job Execution and Completion:
        a: The System Should start executing jobs on the assigned cluster as soon as they are dispatched
        b: once a job completes its execution(after the specified time), the resouces should be freed up

    c: finish job (fallback api: jobId: FINISH/PENDING)

 2: Non Functional Req:
 Scalability:
    a: the System should be able to handle a large number oc clusters and jobs
    b: The System should efficiently manage resources when multiple jobs run concurrenlty on the same cluster
 Concurrency:
    a: The System must support running multiple jobs on the same cluster at the same time, ensuring resources contention is managed
    b: Resource allocation should be thread safe to prevent over allocation

 Latency:
    a: Job Scheduling should be optimized to minimize the wait time before a job is scheduled and executed
 a: System should be highly availalbe
 b: System should be fault tolerance
 c: System should be highly resouce utilize

